https://github.com/robinchrist/wireshark: find the EVPN encapsulation regardless of attribute
order; show EVPN MPLS labels as the 20-bit label (label bits and low-order bits below it, with
a warning when those are set); show the Overlay Index of IP Prefix routes (RFC 9136).

